    "PR description: 'Update time-machine to 5fe25a51... cmake 3.31.10 -> 4.3.3 ... Default Clang/LLVM updated to 22.x and 23.x available. GCC 16 now available.'",
    "Commit 86e44aa97c: 'manifest_build.scm:279:8: warning: \\'ninja\\' is deprecated, use \\'(@ (gnu packages build-tools) ninja)\\' instead'"
  ],
